{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00555",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.82,
      "end_seconds": 9.21,
      "duration_seconds": 8.39,
      "text": "Good morning. I have Odalys Ferreira on my screen. Did I say that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.25,
      "end_seconds": 19.4,
      "duration_seconds": 9.15,
      "text": "Close enough! It's Fer-RAY-ra, but I answer to anything. My own mother mangles the Portuguese half of the name."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.1,
      "end_seconds": 33.65,
      "duration_seconds": 11.55,
      "text": "Fer-RAY-ra, got it. I'm covering for Dr. Haldane today, so I'm reading your chart as we talk. What brings you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.41,
      "end_seconds": 44.83,
      "duration_seconds": 10.42,
      "text": "Mostly my regular check on the HIV. Nine years now, and it's been so well behaved I almost forget about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.3,
      "end_seconds": 54.58,
      "duration_seconds": 8.28,
      "text": "The receptionist also said to mention an allergy thing, because the pharmacy flagged my chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.4,
      "end_seconds": 63.82,
      "duration_seconds": 7.42,
      "text": "Happy to get to that. First, how has the last stretch been for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.99,
      "end_seconds": 82.55,
      "duration_seconds": 17.56,
      "text": "Boring, which I'm told is the goal. Oh, but I parked in the wrong garage today, walked into the dental office across the street, and sat there ten minutes before anyone asked why."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.74,
      "end_seconds": 90.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "Ha. Did they at least offer you a free cleaning?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.78,
      "end_seconds": 96.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "A pamphlet about flossing. That was the whole reward."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.58,
      "end_seconds": 104.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.96,
      "text": "Fair trade. And your routine has been steady, even through the summer?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.42,
      "end_seconds": 119.61,
      "duration_seconds": 14.19,
      "text": "Mostly. I left my bag in a cab at my cousin's wedding in June, with everything in it. Got it back that evening and the driver wouldn't take a tip."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.44,
      "end_seconds": 128.6,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "What a relief. Okay, the allergy. What exactly did the pharmacy flag?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.41,
      "end_seconds": 140.23,
      "duration_seconds": 10.82,
      "text": "My chart just says the word sulfa, nothing next to it, and they wanted to know what actually happens to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.08,
      "end_seconds": 145.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Good question. So what does happen?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.93,
      "end_seconds": 159.37,
      "duration_seconds": 12.44,
      "text": "I'm allergic to sulfa drugs. I get a rash all over, and the last time my lips puffed up too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.89,
      "end_seconds": 167.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "That's a serious reaction. When did you first find out?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.02,
      "end_seconds": 183.01,
      "duration_seconds": 12.99,
      "text": "Years ago, before the HIV diagnosis. I got an antibiotic for something minor and by day three I looked like I'd been dipped in strawberry jam."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.8,
      "end_seconds": 194.59,
      "duration_seconds": 8.79,
      "text": "Dipped in strawberry jam. Vivid. Did anyone ever test you, or is it simply what happened?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.46,
      "end_seconds": 208.54,
      "duration_seconds": 12.08,
      "text": "Just what happened. A dermatologist took photos and wrote sulfa in my file. She was thrilled, honestly, said it was textbook."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.66,
      "end_seconds": 218.26,
      "duration_seconds": 7.6,
      "text": "Did she say whether the lip swelling changes how careful people need to be?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.04,
      "end_seconds": 232.93,
      "duration_seconds": 13.89,
      "text": "She said that was the part that mattered. The rash is a nuisance, but swollen lips means you tell every doctor before they write anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.12,
      "end_seconds": 247.75,
      "duration_seconds": 12.63,
      "text": "She's right. Some of the antibiotics used for people living with HIV are in the sulfa family, so the label matters even more for you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.86,
      "end_seconds": 257.96,
      "duration_seconds": 9.1,
      "text": "That's what the pharmacist said. We ended up chatting about her kid's science fair for twenty minutes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.7,
      "end_seconds": 269.13,
      "duration_seconds": 9.43,
      "text": "A pharmacist who chats. Keep her. Do you carry anything that says what you react to?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.94,
      "end_seconds": 281.64,
      "duration_seconds": 10.7,
      "text": "A medical bracelet. My sister bought it, engraved and everything. Sulfa allergy on one side, emergency contact on the other."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.36,
      "end_seconds": 291.92,
      "duration_seconds": 9.56,
      "text": "Good. Please keep wearing it. Now, mind if I listen to your chest and feel your neck?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.46,
      "end_seconds": 298.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Go ahead. Fair warning, I'm ticklish."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.92,
      "end_seconds": 318.28,
      "duration_seconds": 6.36,
      "text": "I'll be brisk. Deep breath in, and out. Once more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.04,
      "end_seconds": 327.95,
      "duration_seconds": 6.91,
      "text": "Your chest is clear, and everything feels normal in the neck."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.84,
      "end_seconds": 337.24,
      "duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "text": "That's the answer I wanted. Do I get a gold star?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.7,
      "end_seconds": 347.14,
      "duration_seconds": 8.44,
      "text": "Gold star, yes. Honestly, everything I see and hear today fits with your HIV being well controlled."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.97,
      "end_seconds": 358.57,
      "duration_seconds": 8.6,
      "text": "Which is boring. I'll take boring. My neighbor says I'm the most uneventful person on the street."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.56,
      "end_seconds": 369.97,
      "duration_seconds": 9.41,
      "text": "Uneventful is a compliment in this building. Anything you're unsure of with the allergy itself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 371.77,
      "end_seconds": 375.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Should I do anything different on my end?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.86,
      "end_seconds": 388.95,
      "duration_seconds": 12.09,
      "text": "Keep the bracelet on, and tell any new doctor or dentist about the sulfa allergy before they prescribe anything, whatever you're there for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 391.33,
      "end_seconds": 395.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Even the dental office I wandered into by accident?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 397.33,
      "end_seconds": 402.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Especially them. They might still have something for you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 403.22,
      "end_seconds": 406.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Ha. I'll bring up the flossing pamphlet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 409.08,
      "end_seconds": 422.97,
      "duration_seconds": 13.89,
      "text": "Do. I'm going to update your chart so it reads sulfa drugs, with a rash all over and lip swelling, in your own words."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 424.14,
      "end_seconds": 429.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.85,
      "text": "Perfect. The pharmacist will probably do a little dance."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 430.98,
      "end_seconds": 436.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "I'd pay to see that. Anything else on your mind?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 438.62,
      "end_seconds": 446.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.49,
      "text": "Just a question. Is travel okay? My sister is getting married in Lisbon next spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 448.67,
      "end_seconds": 462.96,
      "duration_seconds": 14.29,
      "text": "Travel is fine for someone doing as well as you. Bring a short letter about the allergy, in English and Portuguese if you can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 463.98,
      "end_seconds": 468.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "My mother can translate it. She'll enjoy being useful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 469.75,
      "end_seconds": 475.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "There you go. Congratulations to your sister in advance."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 477.46,
      "end_seconds": 483.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "Thank you. I'll be sure to dance at that one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 486.18,
      "end_seconds": 495.02,
      "duration_seconds": 8.84,
      "text": "I think that covers it. Watch which garage you pick on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 496.18,
      "end_seconds": 499.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Third level, I promise. Thanks, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 502.26,
      "end_seconds": 505.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Take care, Ms. Ferreira."
    }
  ]
}
